  "description": "Fast has never been this fun\n\nOur Lightest Full-Suspension Frame Ever\n\nWith a massive 14.3% weight reduction, Signal Peak 3.0 lets you float up climbs and tackle every challenge with ease. In its lightest configuration, a size large Signal Peak frame tips the scales at 1732 grams. Our refined tube shaping enhances both strength and efficiency, making every ride feel effortless while keeping things simple—no proprietary parts, no unnecessary complexity, just a bike that works as hard as you do.\n\nEvolved Geometry\n\nPowerful Climbs, Unrestrained Descents. A more aggressive 76 degree seat tube angle places you in the optimal pedaling position, while a slacker 66.5 degree head tube angle keeps you composed and confident on descents. With room for longer dropper posts, you can unlock your full potential—climbing with power, descending without restraint.\n\nTetra-Link Race Lite Suspension Platform\n\nControl redefined. By eliminating a pivot and creating a unified rear triangle, we’ve crafted a bike that maximizes power transfer, responsiveness, and efficiency. Whether you're pushing for a podium finish or enjoying a weekend adventure, this suspension platform gives you the stability and speed to ride with confidence.\n\nZero-Energy Flex State at Sag\n\nOptimized for pure efficiency. Our tuned seat stays act as a leaf spring, ensuring your suspension works with you, not against you. Pedaling feels smooth and controlled, so you can focus on the trail ahead, not on wasted energy.",
